      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;fill-your-hole-nigel-watts&#34;&gt;Fill Your Hole Nigel Watts&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Source: &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/discourses/teachers/hole_watts.htm&#34;&gt;TW&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Author: Nigel Watts&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&#34;http://www.amazon.com/exec/obidos/ASIN/0980091225/fromtheunreat-20&#34;&gt;&lt;figure class=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/fill_your_hole.jpg&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;img src=&#34;https://www.advaita.org.uk/images/fill_your_hole.jpg&#34; alt=&#34;&amp;lsquo;Fill Your Hole&amp;rsquo; book cover&#34; title=&#34;&#34;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &#xA;&#xA;&lt;/figure&gt;&#xA;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Visit &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.sunshinefoundation.co.uk/&#34;&gt;Nigel Watts&amp;rsquo; website.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Purchase Nigel&amp;rsquo;s book from his &lt;a href=&#34;http://www.sunshinefoundation.co.uk/&#34;&gt;website&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following are extracts from the above book ‘Fill Your Hole’.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Page 21&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Life doesn’t work how thought you&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Thought you - because you only appear out of thought&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Evolution&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Back in evolution it was paradise but we couldn’t experience it, were just a part of nature. But we gradually became consciously set apart, was meant to be, so we could start to experience how everything is, so we could come to know our real nature.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
